  "changelog": "Umeng Push Helper 1.0.0 - Initial Release\n\n- Provides read-only tools for querying Umeng Push backend data, including app lists, push summaries, weekly reports, push trace analysis, switch statistics, and push closure attribution.\n- Strictly blocks all write or modification APIs for security; only read/query APIs are enabled.\n- Requires users to supply their own Umeng Cookie for all operations, with detailed step-by-step guidance for obtaining and saving the Cookie.\n- Offers command-line scripts for Cookie validation, management, and for fetching core push data.\n- Supports paginated queries and detailed field explanations for all listed functionalities.",
